Validation reported issues. Run the fix command for this loop:

    /gsd-execute-phase 47 --auto

## Completion Protocol (REQUIRED)

When all work is done, your FINAL message must be exactly:

DEVFLOW_RESULT: {"status": "success"}

If something prevents completion:

DEVFLOW_RESULT: {"status": "failed", "reason": "specific explanation"}

DevFlow reads this line to decide whether the stage succeeded. Output nothing after it.
